      "rationale": "The build retains the inflight generation and derives the same agent id for a retry after an uncertain create reply. Lost-reply classification keeps that inflight state; known pre-create refusal clears it and restores the prior generation. This reconciles creation through the same identity rather than blindly minting another seat.",
      "role": "unclassified"
    }
